60
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:10,180
On the menu we have a complimentary glass of wine.

61
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,880
Complimentary glass of wine.

62
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:16,640
Complimentary glass of wine.

63
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:17,140
