64
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,600
That it's free.

65
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,840
Free.

66
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,840
Yes.

67
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,840
We love that, huh?

68
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,200
Yeah, we definitely like free things.

69
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:27,240
Well, I have another one for us here, another interesting phrase.

70
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:28,980
I'll go with.

71
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:30,100
I'll go with.

72
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:31,480
I'll go with.

73
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:33,060
I'll go with.

74
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:36,380
So basically it's another way of saying I'm choosing.

75
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:38,560
Yeah, I'll choose or I'll take.

76
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:39,300
I'll take.

77
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,560
OK, very good.

78
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:46,000
